The streaming host loop (lib/src/stream.dart, tool/onnx_stream.py) is a port of
`runtime/run_rt.py` from MeanVC2 (https://github.com/ASLP-lab/MeanVC2,
Apache-2.0, Guobin Ma, Yuxuan Xia, Yuepeng Jiang, Dake Guo, Hanke Xie,
Jingbin Hu, Yanbo Wang, Lei Xie, Pengcheng Zhu). The exporters in tool/ load
the MeanVC2, Vocos (MIT), WeNet Fast-U2++ (Apache-2.0) and s3prl WavLM
(Apache-2.0 code, MIT WavLM) modules and re-express parts of them for ONNX.

Model weights
-------------
The model weights are not in this package or repository. They are downloaded
from https://huggingface.co/kiarina/MeanVC2-ONNX, which has its own NOTICE,
and are licensed per part:

  - Conversion graphs (fbank, asr, gtm, dit, vocos): Apache License 2.0
  - Speaker encoder (speaker/speaker*.onnx, used by SpeakerEncoder):
    Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported, NOT Apache-2.0.
    It is Microsoft's WavLM-Large + ECAPA-TDNN speaker verification model
    (microsoft/UniSpeech). Apps that download and ship it must follow
    CC BY-SA 3.0 for that file; apps that only pass embeddings to
    MeanVc2Stream.setTarget do not need it.
